      "kind": "shape",
      "text": "HIGHLIGHTS \nWe track a set of nine Board-approved Key Risk Indicators (KRIs) which are reported every quarter\nFor F26, we tightened our KRI targets, with the expectation that we would reduce risk over time\nTherefore, we expect that, in the short-term, many of our metrics would fall outside of tolerance limits, with progress made over subsequent quarters  \nThe current set of KRIs have a remediation focus; we are planning to evolve them to ensure they track towards reducing risk overall",
